PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGrampsIsntAround::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Oh, it's just {PLAYER}.\n"
    .string "Gramps isn't here right now.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalFedUpWithWaiting::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Gramps! Where do you keep\n"
    .string "running off to?\p"
    .string "I've been standing here forever!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalNoFairWhatAboutMe::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hey, hold on! Gramps!\n"
    .string "That's not fair!\p"
    .string "What about me?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoChoosePlayer::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Relax, I'm not gonna fight\n"
    .string "you for it.\p"
    .string "Unlike some people, I can share.\n"
    .string "I'm basically an adult now.\p"
    .string "Go on, {PLAYER}. Pick first,\n"
    .string "since you're clearly nervous.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllTakeThisOneThen::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Fine, I'll take this one.\n"
    .string "Wasn't my first choice anyway.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalReceivedMonFromOak::
    .string "{RIVAL} received the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
    .string "from PROF. OAK!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalMyMonLooksTougher::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Not bad, but check mine\n"
    .string "out. Way tougher-looking, right?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLetsCheckOutMons::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Oh, hey, {PLAYER}! Perfect\n"
    .string "timing, actually.\p"
    .string "We've both had our POKéMON a\n"
    .string "little while now. Let's see who\l"
    .string "picked the winner.\p"
    .string "Come on, I'll show you how it's\n"
    .string "done!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalDefeat::
    .string "WHAT?\n"
    .string "No way!\l"
    .string "I had the wrong POKéMON all\l"
    .string "along?!$"

@ Also used for early Route 22 battle
Text_RivalVictory::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Ha! Yeah!\n"
    .string "That's how it's done.\p"
    .string "Told you mine was tougher.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGoToughenMyMon::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Tch, fine, whatever. I'll\n"
    .string "just have to train it harder.\p"
    .string "{PLAYER}! Gramps!\n"
    .string "Catch you two later!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalGramps::
    .string "{RIVAL}: You bellowed, Gramps?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalWhatDidYouCallMeFor::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Oh, right, that. I got so\n"
    .string "distracted I almost forgot.\p"
    .string "So what did you need me for?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalLeaveItToMeGramps::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Say no more, Gramps!\n"
    .string "You can count on me!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalTellSisNotToGiveYouMap::
    .string "{PLAYER}, look, I don't love saying\n"
    .string "this, but you're not gonna need\l"
    .string "that TOWN MAP.\p"
    .string "I'll just borrow one off my sis\n"
    .string "before you get the chance!\p"
    .string "I'll even tell her not to lend\n"
    .string "you one, {PLAYER}! Hah!\p"
    .string "Don't bother stopping by my\n"
    .string "place after this, either!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThreeMonsChooseOne::
    .string "OAK: {RIVAL}? Hold your\n"
    .string "POKéMON, let me think a moment…\p"
    .string "Oh! Right, right, I did tell you\n"
    .string "to come by. My mistake, just\l"
    .string "give me a moment, would you?\p"
    .string "Now then, {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You've caught me at a good time,\n"
    .string "actually. Take a look at this.\p"
    .string "Three POKéMON, right here in\n"
    .string "these POKé BALLS.\p"
    .string "Heh, I know, I know.\p"
    .string "Believe it or not, I was quite\n"
    .string "the TRAINER myself, once upon\l"
    .string "a time.\p"
    .string "These days, though, I'm an old\n"
    .string "man who talks too much, and\l"
    .string "these three are all I've got left.\p"
    .string "So go on, take your pick.\n"
    .string "One of them is yours now.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBePatientRival::
    .string "OAK: Patience, {RIVAL}, patience!\n"
    .string "You'll get yours too.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakWhichOneWillYouChoose::
    .string "OAK: Now then, {PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "Inside those three POKé BALLS,\n"
    .string "you'll find three POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Go on and have a look. Which\n"
    .string "one calls out to you?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHeyDontGoAwayYet::
    .string "OAK: Whoa, hold it right there!\n"
    .string "We're not quite finished yet!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingCharmander::
    .string "Ah, CHARMANDER, is it? Good\n"
    .string "choice. It's got fire in its belly,\l"
    .string "so raise it with a steady hand.\p"
    .string "So, {PLAYER}, you're sure about\n"
    .string "this? The FIRE POKéMON,\l"
    .string "CHARMANDER?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingSquirtle::
    .string "Hm, SQUIRTLE! A dependable\n"
    .string "sort. You could do a lot worse.\p"
    .string "So, {PLAYER}, this is the one, then?\n"
    .string "The WATER POKéMON, SQUIRTLE?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakChoosingBulbasaur::
    .string "Ah, BULBASAUR! A fine pick for a\n"
    .string "beginner, if I do say so myself.\p"
    .string "So, {PLAYER}, you'll be going with\n"
    .string "the GRASS POKéMON, BULBASAUR?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakThisMonIsEnergetic::
    .string "Ha! This one's got some real\n"
    .string "energy to it, doesn't it?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedMonFromOak::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the {STR_VAR_1}\n"
    .string "from PROF. OAK!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCanReachNextTownWithMon::
    .string "OAK: Should a wild POKéMON turn\n"
    .string "up, don't panic. Your POKéMON\l"
    .string "can handle it.\p"
    .string "With a partner like that at your\n"
    .string "side, you'll make it to the next\l"
    .string "town just fine.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakBattleMonForItToGrow::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}, a young POKéMON\n"
    .string "only grows stronger through\l"
    .string "battle.\p"
    .string "Don't be afraid to let it fight.\n"
    .string "That's how it learns.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveSomethingForMe::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}! There you are.\n"
    .string "How's my old POKéMON treating\l"
    .string "you?\p"
    .string "Judging by that look, the two of\n"
    .string "you have gotten rather close.\p"
    .string "I daresay you've got a real knack\n"
    .string "for this TRAINER business.\p"
    .string "Now, hold on… is that for me?\n"
    .string "You brought something, didn't\l"
    .string "you?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DeliveredOaksParcel::
    .string "{PLAYER} delivered OAK'S PARCEL.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCustomBallIOrdered::
    .string "Ah, wonderful!\n"
    .string "This is the custom POKé BALL\l"
    .string "I ordered!\p"
    .string "I'd nearly given up on it.\n"
    .string "Thank you, {PLAYER}!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakHaveRequestForYouTwo::
    .string "OAK: Oh, that reminds me!\n"
    .string "I have a favor to ask you both,\l"
    .string "while I've got you here.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakPokedexOnDesk::
    .string "You see that on the desk? That's\n"
    .string "my own invention, the POKéDEX.\p"
    .string "It logs data automatically on\n"
    .string "every POKéMON you've seen or\l"
    .string "caught.\p"
    .string "A complete encyclopedia, right\n"
    .string "there in your pocket!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTakeTheseWithYou::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}, {RIVAL}, listen up.\n"
    .string "Take these with you.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedPokedexFromOak::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the POKéDEX\n"
    .string "from PROF. OAK.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCatchMonsForDataTakeThese::
    .string "OAK: Seeing a POKéMON only gets\n"
    .string "you half the picture, mind you.\p"
    .string "To fill in the rest, you'll need\n"
    .string "to catch them yourself.\p"
    .string "Which is why I'm giving you\n"
    .string "these. Should come in handy.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ReceivedFivePokeBalls::
    .string "{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakExplainCatching::
    .string "Here's the basics: spot a wild\n"
    .string "POKéMON, and it's fair game.\p"
    .string "Chuck a POKé BALL at it and hope\n"
    .string "for the best.\p"
    .string "Though I'll warn you now, it\n"
    .string "won't always take.\p"
    .string "A POKéMON at full health can\n"
    .string "wriggle right back out. You'll\l"
    .string "need a bit of luck on your side!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakCompleteMonGuideWasMyDream::
    .string "A complete record of every\n"
    .string "POKéMON in the world…\p"
    .string "That's been my dream since I\n"
    .string "was younger than you two.\p"
    .string "But I'm an old man now, and\n"
    .string "my traveling days are behind me.\p"
    .string "So I'm asking the both of you to\n"
    .string "chase that dream in my place.\p"
    .string "Go on, get out there!\p"
    .string "This is nothing less than a\n"
    .string "milestone in POKéMON history!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMonsAroundWorldWait::
    .string "OAK: Out there, somewhere, a\n"
    .string "POKéMON is waiting to meet you,\l"
    .string "{PLAYER}!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakAddedNothingToPokedex::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}! Just the person.\n"
    .string "How's that POKéDEX coming\l"
    .string "along?\p"
    .string "{RIVAL} has already caught a fair\n"
    .string "few and logged the data.\p"
    .string "Let's see, {PLAYER}. Pull up your\n"
    .string "POKéDEX for me, would you?\p"
    .string "…Hm. Something the matter?\n"
    .string "You haven't logged a single new\l"
    .string "entry.\p"
    .string "Well, here, take these. Maybe\n"
    .string "they'll light a fire under you.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakComeSeeMeSometime::
    .string "OAK: Do stop by again sometime.\p"
    .string "I'm always curious how that\n"
    .string "POKéDEX of yours is filling out.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_BlankEncyclopedia::
    .string "Looks like an encyclopedia, but\n"
    .string "every page is empty.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_ThoseArePokeBalls::
    .string "Those are POKé BALLS.\n"
    .string "There's a POKéMON sealed inside\l"
    .string "each one!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OaksLastMon::
    .string "That's the last POKéMON PROF.\n"
    .string "OAK has left.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PressStartToOpenMenu::
    .string "Press START to open the MENU!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_SaveOptionInMenu::
    .string "You'll find SAVE in the MENU.\n"
    .string "Get in the habit of using it.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_AllMonTypesHaveStrongAndWeakPoints::
    .string "Every POKéMON type has something\n"
    .string "it's strong against, and\l"
    .string "something it's weak to.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_EmailMessage::
    .string "There's an e-mail message here.\p"
    .string "…\p"
    .string "At last!\n"
    .string "The POKéMON LEAGUE's finest\l"
    .string "TRAINERS stand ready, and they'll\l"
    .string "take on all challengers!\p"
    .string "Bring your strongest team and\n"
    .string "find out where you rank!\p"
    .string "POKéMON LEAGUE HQ\n"
    .string "INDIGO PLATEAU\p"
    .string "PROF. OAK, your presence is\n"
    .string "requested!\p"
    .string "…$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_StudyAsOaksAide::
    .string "I study POKéMON under PROF.\n"
    .string "OAK, as one of his AIDES.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_DaisyWillGroomMons::
    .string "Hi, {PLAYER}. I bet you and your\n"
    .string "POKéMON are getting along well\l"
    .string "by now.\p"
    .string "Say, has anyone told you about\n"
    .string "DAISY yet?\p"
    .string "Show her your POKéMON sometime\n"
    .string "and she can tell you exactly how\l"
    .string "fond of you it's grown.\p"
    .string "If you're lucky, she might even\n"
    .string "give it a little grooming.\p"
    .string "Just, uh, keep that between us,\n"
    .string "would you?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsGoingToHaveRadioShow::
    .string "Word is PROF. OAK's getting his\n"
    .string "own radio show soon.\p"
    .string "They're calling it PROF. OAK's\n"
    .string "POKéMON SEMINAR.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakIsAuthorityOnMons::
    .string "PROF. OAK doesn't look it, but\n"
    .string "he's about as authoritative on\l"
    .string "POKéMON as they come.\p"
    .string "Plenty of TRAINERS out there\n"
    .string "hold him in very high regard.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakFavorToAskYouPlayer::
    .string "Ah, {PLAYER}! This works out\n"
    .string "rather well, actually.\p"
    .string "I have another favor to ask of\n"
    .string "you, and it's an important one.\p"
    .string "Give me a moment of your time,\n"
    .string "won't you?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakSightingsOfRareMons::
    .string "Reports have been coming in of\n"
    .string "some rather unusual POKéMON\l"
    .string "sightings lately.\p"
    .string "Species that, as far as I know,\n"
    .string "have never once been recorded\l"
    .string "in KANTO.\p"
    .string "I'd love nothing more than to\n"
    .string "investigate myself, but, well…\l"
    .string "these old legs aren't what they\l"
    .string "used to be.\p"
    .string "So, {PLAYER}, since I can't go\n"
    .string "myself, would you go in my\l"
    .string "stead?$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalJustLetMeHandleEverything::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Hold on, I heard that!\p"
    .string "Seriously, Gramps, what's with\n"
    .string "always going to {PLAYER} first?\p"
    .string "I've caught more POKéMON than\n"
    .string "them, and I did it faster, too.\p"
    .string "Just leave this one to me. I've\n"
    .string "got it covered.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNeedYourHelpTooNeedToSeePokedexes::
    .string "OAK: Yes, yes, I know.\n"
    .string "Of course I need you as well,\l"
    .string "{RIVAL}.\p"
    .string "Now then, hand over your\n"
    .string "POKéDEXES, the both of you.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakTookBothPokedexUnits::
    .string "PROF. OAK took both POKéDEX\n"
    .string "units.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakNowTheseUnitsCanRecordMoreData::
    .string "… … …  … … …\p"
    .string "… … …  … … …\p"
    .string "…There. All done.\p"
    .string "These units can now record data\n"
    .string "on a great many more POKéMON.$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_PlayersPokedexWasUpgraded::
    .string "{PLAYER}'s POKéDEX was upgraded!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMustReallyWorkToFillPokedex::
    .string "OAK: Now then, {PLAYER}, {RIVAL}!\p"
    .string "This time around, I want you\n"
    .string "both to really commit to filling\l"
    .string "out those POKéDEXES.\p"
    .string "Make them the finest, most\n"
    .string "complete records this world has\l"
    .string "ever seen!\p"
    .string "I mean it. This is a genuinely\n"
    .string "monumental undertaking!$"

PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_RivalIllCompleteThePokedex::
    .string "{RIVAL}: Easy, Gramps, easy. No\n"
    .string "need to get worked up about it.\p"
    .string "I'll finish that POKéDEX myself,\n"
    .string "don't you worry.\p"
    .string "Think I'll start over on ONE\n"
    .string "ISLAND, actually…\p"
    .string "Anyway, catch you two later!$"


PalletTown_ProfessorOaksLab_Text_OakMewHint::
    .string "OAK: {PLAYER}, hold on a moment!\p"
    .string "Now that you've caught so many\n"
    .string "POKéMON, there's something I\l"
    .string "should probably tell you.\p"
    .string "Years back, while I was doing\n"
    .string "fieldwork in GUYANA, South\l"
    .string "America…\p"
    .string "I heard talk of a mythical\n"
    .string "POKéMON, said to be the ancestor\l"
    .string "of every other species.\p"
    .string "They called it MEW.\p"
    .string "I spent years chasing that rumor\n"
    .string "and never found a shred of\l"
    .string "proof…\p"
    .string "Still, I've always had a hunch\n"
    .string "that if MEW exists anywhere at\l"
    .string "all…\p"
    .string "It would be somewhere brimming\n"
    .string "with natural energy.\p"
    .string "Somewhere like… CERULEAN\n"
    .string "CAVE!\p"
    .string "The psychic energy in that cave\n"
    .string "is unlike anywhere else in\l"
    .string "KANTO.\p"
    .string "If you're brave enough to make\n"
    .string "it to its deepest chamber…\p"
    .string "You might just come face to face\n"
    .string "with MEW itself!$"
